      },
      "text": "### Navier-Stokes"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-AERODYNAMICS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "01-AERODYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics, git-history:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "current_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:aeronautics:aerodynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "aeronautics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "section": "aeronautics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Aerodynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCONTINUITY (mass conservation):\n  ∂ρ/∂t + ∇·(ρ**u**) = 0\n  Incompressible (ρ = const): ∇·**u** = 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-AERODYNAMICS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-AERODYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics, git-history:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "current_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:aeronautics:aerodynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "aeronautics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "section": "aeronautics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Aerodynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MOMENTUM (N-S):\n  ρ(∂**u**/∂t + **u**·∇**u**) = −∇p + μ∇²**u** + ρ**g**\n  Left: inertia; Right: pressure gradient + viscous + body force\n  Incompressible + steady: ρ(**u**·∇)**u** = −∇p + μ∇²**u**"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-AERODYNAMICS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-AERODYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics, git-history:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "current_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:aeronautics:aerodynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "aeronautics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "section": "aeronautics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Aerodynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ENERGY (for compressible):\n  ρDe/Dt = −p(∇·**u**) + Φ + ∇·(k∇T)\n  Φ = viscous dissipation; k = thermal conductivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-AERODYNAMICS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "01-AERODYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics, git-history:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "current_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:aeronautics:aerodynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "aeronautics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "section": "aeronautics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Aerodynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "REYNOLDS NUMBER: Re = ρVL/μ = VL/ν\n  Ratio of inertial to viscous forces\n  Low Re (< ~10³): viscous dominated; laminar; no separation\n  High Re (>10⁶): inertia dominated; thin boundary layer; potential flow core\n  Transition: Re_crit ≈ 5×10⁵ for flat plate; variable for airfoils (depends on pressure gradient)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-AERODYNAMICS.md#013",
      "path": [
        "01-AERODYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics, git-history:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "current_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:aeronautics:aerodynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "aeronautics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[aerodynamics]",
        "section": "aeronautics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Aerodynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BERNOULLI EQUATION (incompressible, inviscid, steady, along streamline):\n  p + ½ρV² + ρgh = constant = p₀ (total pressure)\n  Dynamic pressure: q = ½ρV²\n  Stagnation (total) pressure: p₀ = p + q\n  Pitot tube: measures p₀; static port measures p; q = p₀ - p → V = √(2q/ρ)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-AERODYNAMICS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "01-AERODYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics, git-history:aeronautics:01-aerodynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "aeronautics/01-AERODYNAMICS.md",
